 after a big meal.

102
00:02:55.942 --> 00:02:57.476
 The itis?

103
00:02:57.477 --> 00:02:58.843
 You know, Robert,

104
00:02:58.844 --> 00:03:02.414
 I own a little health food spot
 near Meadowlark Park.

105
