 hot armpit on wheat bread.

107
00:03:07.185 --> 00:03:09.621
 I've been thinking
 about making a change.

108
00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:10.988
 You interested?

109
00:03:10.989 --> 00:03:12.590
 My own restaurant.

110
00:03:12.591 --> 00:03:13.624
 Mm-hm.

111
00:03:13.625 --> 00:03:14.792
 Uh...

112
