 a lounge singer.

115
00:03:21.867 --> 00:03:24.168
 I sing, Robert.

116
00:03:24.169 --> 00:03:25.303
 I could...

117
00:03:25.304 --> 00:03:26.671
 [YAWNS]

118
00:03:26.672 --> 00:03:29.141
 I could sing to the people
 while they...

119
00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:30.141
 [YAWNS]

120
