126
00:03:39.953 --> 00:03:41.019
 Good idea.

127
00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.153
 [SNORING]

128
00:03:42.154 --> 00:03:44.188
 We should get together
 tomorrow and talk.

129
00:03:44.189 --> 00:03:45.823
 [SNORING]

130
00:03:45.824 --> 00:03:47.124
 [YAWNS]

131
00:03:47.125 --> 00:03:49.462
 My own r-restra...

132
