 for immigrant workers?

154
00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:42.914
 If you don't get
 that bullshit

155
00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:44.883
out of my face, bitch...

156
00:04:44.884 --> 00:04:45.950
 [INDISTINCT CHATTER]

157
